==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*4 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
**3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.2 seconds<sup>2f~36f</sup>.
**5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.2 seconds<sup>2f~36f</sup>.
**1 [[Kiss and Koi (Enemy)|Kiss and Koi]] spawns.
**7 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**7 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**7 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Kiss and Koi (Enemy)|Kiss and Koi]] spawns.
**4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Kiss and Koi (Enemy)|Kiss and Koi]] spawns.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the starting enemies for cash. Some recommended [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|backliners]] are [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. You can also use [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to eliminate the peons, letting single attack units have a chance at damaging the boss.

If you own [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] by this point, he can be timed with a [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] to get some quick hits in. But usually, he is outranged and cannot do anything before being juggled to death.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage is a reference to the phrase ''carpe diem'', which in Latin means "seize the day".

